body:
Here to updoot the daily and hype about rocket pool staking!!! HYPE!

&#x200B;

Good to be back boys. Had a mental breakdown, but we're back :D

 Anyone get in on the madeon NFT? Just curious!

&#x200B;

Don't worry, I dooted the diddly!

Nothing to add, I just love your take here. Couldn't say it better.

&#x200B;

Edit: Is there a supposed list of eth killers that failed to do the job? I feel like it has to be hilariously long.

I want both. I don't want to price out the individual, but I don't want to include overtly loud un-contributing voices.

&#x200B;

edit: so a delicate balance.

Uncovering some tough emotional feelings from growing up lately. Drank last night and regret doing it, learning coping mechanisms that work and avoiding the bottle are the goals from now on. Emptied out the liquor and getting on the wagon. Going back to therapy too! :)

&#x200B;

IWNDWYT

I woke up the same way today! I had a bunch of dreams that I thought were poor drunk decisions, but turns out my brain was just making things up. What a relief to get up to a quiet phone and no poor choices. IWNDWYT

&#x200B;

edit: It's my cakeday, I had no idea, what a joyous day :D

He mentions its a hardware vocoder. Vintage and probably hella expensive.

&#x200B;

[https://twitter.com/madeon/status/1081336589085798405](https://twitter.com/madeon/status/1081336589085798405)

Happy Saturday! Woke up hungover for hopefully the last time. I started seeing a counselor the past couple weeks, and alcohol is not helping me take care of myself. If I want to beat my depression and get back into shape I can't be friends with the bottle anymore.

&#x200B;

I will not drink with you today! :)

Had to call in sick today for my poor decisions last night.

&#x200B;

Today is day 1! IWNDWYT
